Subject: [PATCH] fix(gates): keep the auto-heal comment out of the D20
 hot-path census

---
 .../bd-call-site-kill-list.md                                | 5 ++---
 lefthook.yml                                                 | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/work/2026-06-06-kernel-backlog-memory-roadmap/bd-call-site-kill-list.md b/docs/work/2026-06-06-kernel-backlog-memory-roadmap/bd-call-site-kill-list.md
index 63a002fd..2de90a9a 100644
--- a/docs/work/2026-06-06-kernel-backlog-memory-roadmap/bd-call-site-kill-list.md
+++ b/docs/work/2026-06-06-kernel-backlog-memory-roadmap/bd-call-site-kill-list.md
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ Purpose: tracked migration artifact for D20 so later PRs can remove Beads/Dolt h
 | runtime | 118 | 21 |
 | docs | 386 | 45 |
 | skills | 1 | 1 |
-| hooks | 1 | 1 |
+| hooks | 0 | 0 |
 
 ## command
 
@@ -173,5 +173,4 @@ Purpose: tracked migration artifact for D20 so later PRs can remove Beads/Dolt h
 
 ## hooks
 
-- [ ] lefthook.yml (1)
-  - lines: 24 (bd)
+No current call sites in this group.
diff --git a/lefthook.yml b/lefthook.yml
index 1c81c591..c599abc7 100644
--- a/lefthook.yml
+++ b/lefthook.yml
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@ pre-commit:
       stage_fixed: false
       tags: skills
       glob: "skills/**"
-    # Keep the D20 bd call-site kill-list current with the census it audits.
+    # Keep the D20 Beads call-site kill-list current with the census it audits.
     # Self-gating: the script exits early unless a staged path actually counts toward
     # the census, because those scan roots are resolved at run time (plugin manifests +
     # .forge/sync-manifest.json) and a static glob here would drift from the gate.
